- Sidecars: raster spikes 54 == round(168 x 8.0 x 0.040); energy 1242 pJ /
  0.001242 uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt 16 events inside [0, 40000] us,
  neuron_id < 168, same-neuron gap N/A (unique ids) / >=1000 us; routing 4
  entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 0.88 s
  == 880 ms; gate_snn pools 47/17/5 == round(n x rate x 0.025) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (header-dilution of a single-cell
crossover), the domain (PEM water electrolysis), the cathode-step
probe discriminant, the three-edge scar with any-pair-rollback-fails, the
primary negative-result (correct MODIFY, PTL still hydrides on unmonitored
